From: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 16:06:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 763/913] core: pta: stm32mp: remoteproc: parse RSA-2048 DER
 key

Introduce a DER length parser and use it in RSA parsing instead
of relying on fixed DER headers and fixed offsets.

This prepare the support of the RSA-4096 enforcing a 256-byte modulus
and a 3-byte exponent, while making the parser robust to DER length
encoding.

